  "_design_note": "M3.1 stabilized handcrafted-feature MLP baseline. M3.0 is the completed R02 online-SGD control (runs/m3_r02_a06_t02_n5_20260826/) and remains immutable. This arm preserves the 44-64-32-6 ReLU MLP, A06, E01, C00 Loot-Crate task, n=5, fresh starts, budgets and seed protocol, but uses the declared R02_1 fitted-Q recipe: Adam lr=0.001, unit-delta Huber TD loss, global gradient clipping at 10, uniform replay and a frozen target network. handcrafted_v1 already uses fixed semantic range scaling; no running standardizer is introduced because it would require training-state persistence and can shift the policy at evaluation time. This is a practical stabilization bundle, not an attribution claim about any individual component.",
